are, it's about with not depth, you know, like it's about, I mean, a kind of crude term is body count, you know, how many women can he be with, even in one night, you know, how many numbers can he get, how many connections can he forge, how many women can he take home or get to their place.
而且，这关乎的不是深度，你知道的，就像是，粗俗点说就是“战绩”，你知道的，他能和多少女性在一起，甚至在一个晚上，你知道的，他能拿到多少个电话号码，他能建立多少联系，他能把多少女性带回家或者去她们的住处。

